WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.061 --> 00:00:01.860
Roxy scratched her head.

2
00:00:01.861 --> 00:00:04.987
"If you didn't open the portal, who did?"

3
00:00:04.988 --> 00:00:07.326
Zark pressed buttons on a device.

4
00:00:07.327 --> 00:00:11.232
"I have no idea. Our trackers can't seem to find—"

5
00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:15.342
Voop! Another portal opened.

6
00:00:15.343 --> 00:00:19.422
A figure stepped out, wearing thick armor and a spiky helmet.

7
00:00:19.423 --> 00:00:21.249
A visor covered its face.

8
00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.453
"Are you Rocket Girl?" the figure asked.

9
00:00:26.454 --> 00:00:30.921
Roxy raised an eyebrow. "Yeah. Who are you?"

10
00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:36.792
The creature stepped closer. "I'm the Battle Master."

11
00:00:36.793 --> 00:00:42.311
Roxy frowned. "Did you open that . . ."

12
00:00:42.312 --> 00:00:44.747
She felt an invisible force squeeze her.

13
00:00:44.748 --> 00:00:47.627
"Hey! What's going on?"

14
00:00:47.628 --> 00:00:54.462
The Battle Master stepped aside, and the invisible force dragged Roxy through the portal.

15
00:00:54.463 --> 00:01:00.678
The figure followed.

16
00:01:00.679 --> 00:01:05.359
Roxy struggled to free herself. "Who do you think you are?"

17
00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:11.081
Suddenly everything grew dark. Roxy felt the force let go of her, and she charged forward.

18
00:01:11.082 --> 00:01:13.501
Bonk! She hit a wall.

19
00:01:13.502 --> 00:01:18.419
Dim lights turned on, and Roxy realized she was in a clear, floating cube.

20
00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:20.388
The Battle Master was gone.

21
00:01:20.389 --> 00:01:22.159
"Rocket Girl!"

22
00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.099
Roxy spun around.

23
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.534
Cozlin was in a floating cube too.

24
00:01:26.535 --> 00:01:30.519
Their cubes floated in a vast, open space.

25
00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:33.115
"Where are we?" Roxy asked.

26
00:01:33.116 --> 00:01:38.113
"I don't know, but I'm not staying here!" Cozlin punched a wall.

27
00:01:38.114 --> 00:01:40.793
"Ouch." She shook out her hand.

28
00:01:40.794 --> 00:01:44.404
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

29
00:01:44.405 --> 00:01:48.908
Ping! Ping! The laser beams bounced all over the cube.

30
00:01:48.909 --> 00:01:53.559
"Ahh!" Roxy ducked and jumped to avoid them.

31
00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.586
Then she stared at the wall.

32
00:01:55.587 --> 00:01:58.436
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

33
00:01:58.437 --> 00:02:00.779
The air in the cube heated up.

34
00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:05.119
"Yikes!" Roxy blew her freeze breath to cool it down.

35
00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:07.650
Cozlin ran and threw herself against a wall.

36
00:02:07.651 --> 00:02:09.603
Roxy stomped her foot.

37
00:02:09.604 --> 00:02:12.385
She pounded on the wall, but it didn't break.

38
00:02:12.386 --> 00:02:17.139
"This isn't working!" Roxy sat down and sighed.

39
00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:20.173
"How will we get out of . . . Hey, wait!

40
00:02:20.174 --> 00:02:22.568
You can walk through walls!"

41
00:02:22.569 --> 00:02:24.181
Cozlin shook her head.

42
00:02:24.182 --> 00:02:28.077
"I tried that before you got here. It didn't work either.

43
00:02:28.078 --> 00:02:32.080
I tried calling Delkor too. I can't get a connection."

44
00:02:32.081 --> 00:02:33.888
Roar!

45
00:02:33.889 --> 00:02:36.993
They looked down and gasped.

46
00:02:36.994 --> 00:02:40.150
The dragon was in a large cube below them.

47
00:02:40.151 --> 00:02:44.417
The cube shook as the dragon clawed at the walls surrounding it.

48
00:02:44.418 --> 00:02:50.664
Cozlin chuckled. "At least we're not stuck in a cube with that dragon!"

49
00:02:50.665 --> 00:02:56.108
Roxy frowned. "How can you laugh right now? This is all your fault!"

50
00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:59.204
"It's the dragon's fault!" Cozlin said.

51
00:02:59.205 --> 00:03:01.144
"It tried to destroy—"

52
00:03:01.145 --> 00:03:04.782
"You're the one who let the dragon out!" Roxy cried.

53
00:03:04.783 --> 00:03:07.859
"Just because you wanted some stupid gold!"

54
00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:12.788
Cozlin folded her arms. "Look, I said I was sorry."

55
00:03:12.789 --> 00:03:15.954
Roxy gasped. "No, you didn't!"

56
00:03:15.955 --> 00:03:18.927
Cozlin scratched her head. "I didn't?"

57
00:03:18.928 --> 00:03:24.831
Roxy groaned. "I can't believe this is happening."

58
00:03:24.832 --> 00:03:27.709
Just then bright light shined down on them.

59
00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.899
The cubes rose.

60
00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:32.012
Now Roxy saw other cubes.

61
00:03:32.013 --> 00:03:33.892
Each one held a prisoner.

62
00:03:33.893 --> 00:03:36.390
A lot of the prisoners looked pretty tough.

63
00:03:36.391 --> 00:03:42.316
The roar of a crowd grew louder as the cubes rose higher.

64
00:03:42.317 --> 00:03:44.718
"Whoa!" Roxy said.

65
00:03:44.719 --> 00:03:47.638
They were now in an enormous arena.

66
00:03:47.639 --> 00:03:54.767
The stands were filled with all sorts of cheering aliens.

67
00:03:54.768 --> 00:03:58.440
"Welcome to the Stadium of the Stars!"

68
00:03:58.441 --> 00:04:03.525
The Battle Master appeared on a floating platform, and his voice thundered through the arena.

69
00:04:03.526 --> 00:04:06.623
"I am the Battle Master.

70
00:04:06.624 --> 00:04:20.945
And this is the galaxy's greatest competition—the Galactic Battle Bonanza!"

